  "details": "It used to be that group notifications also had a \"view group\" button\n\nthis made it easy to navigate to a group you got a notification for and were easily able to join any instances the had open. \n\nnow you have to navigate to the group manually which if you have a ton of groups can be daunting especially since theres no way to sort groups alphabetically. (yes i know theres a dropdown for this under group activity but it doesnt actually do anything)\n\nPLEASE bring back the view group button on group notifications, it was so useful!",
